# Nothing reads this any more, and it is here because a workflow copies it.
#
# It was the environment for Supabase's local Edge Runtime — `WEB_APP_ORIGIN` for CORS, the TfL keys,
# the OpenAI key, the backfill token. There are no Edge Functions left: everything this app runs
# server-side is a route under `apps/web/src/app/api/`, and its environment is the workspace-root
# `.env` (see `.env.example`) locally and the Vercel project in production.
#
# `.github/workflows/check.yml` runs `cp supabase/.env.example supabase/.env` before `supabase start`
# in two jobs, so deleting this file turns both of them red. Those two lines and this file go
# together, in a change that can push `.github/workflows/**` — see #122.
